  "notes": "{偏|かたよ}る means to be biased or physically uneven.\n\nFORMS:\n- {偏|かたよ}る (dictionary form)\n- {偏|かたよ}った (past/attributive - \"biased\")\n- {偏|かたよ}り (noun form - \"bias, unevenness\")\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {意見|いけん}が{偏|かたよ}る (opinions are biased)\n- {栄養|えいよう}が{偏|かたよ}る (nutrition is unbalanced)\n- {偏|かたよ}った{見方|みかた} (biased view)\n- {偏|かたよ}った{食事|しょくじ} (unbalanced diet)\n- {偏|かたよ}りなく (without bias, evenly)\n\nNOUN FORM {偏|かたよ}り:\n- {偏|かたよ}りがある (there is bias)\n- {偏|かたよ}りをなくす (to eliminate bias)\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {偏|かたよ}る is intransitive\n- {偏|かたよ}らせる is the transitive/causative form\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {偏見|へんけん} (prejudice, bias - noun)\n- {片寄|かたよ}る (variant writing)\n- {傾|かたむ}く (to lean, tilt)\n\nREGISTER: Neutral. Common in everyday and formal contexts.",
